{"sha": "156a2eb7f8541632f466753fba0cc986a890e449dd45aa66129669b7d6910a51", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:b1:systems-of-points} 章 --- 质点组；刚体初步}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:systems-of-points:1}", "$x_G = (2.0 \\times 0 + 3.0 \\times 1.0)/5.0 = \\qty{0.60}{m}$。地月系统：", "$384000/82 = \\qty{4700}{km}$，即距地心 \\qty{4700}{km}，位于地球内部", "（\\qty{6370}{km}）：地球绕一点摆动，该点位于", "其表面以下 \\qty{1700}{km} 处。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:systems-of-points:2}", "$4.0v = 0.010 \\times 800$：$v = \\qty{2.0}{m/s}$。子弹 $\\tfrac12 \\times 0.010", "\\times 800^2 = \\qty{3.2}{kJ}$，步枪 \\qty{8}{J}：来自火药的", "化学能；轻的物体几乎获得全部能量（$E_k = p^2/2m$", "，动量 $p$ 相同）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:systems-of-points:3}", "$v = 20000/2500 = \\qty{8.0}{m/s}$；$E_k$：碰撞前 \\qty{200}{kJ}，$\\tfrac12 \\times", "2500 \\times 64 = \\qty{80}{kJ}$（碰撞后），损失 $60\\%$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:systems-of-points:4}", "端点：$\\int_0^L x^2(M/L)\\dd x = ML^2/3$；中心：$\\int_{-L/2}^{L/2}x^2(M/L)", "\\dd x = ML^2/12$；由惠更斯定理，取 $d = L/2$：$ML^2/12 + ML^2/4 = ML^2/3$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:systems-of-points:5}", "$E_k = \\tfrac12 Mv^2(1 + k)$：圆柱体为 $1.5$，圆环为 $2$，均乘以 $\\tfrac12 Mv^2$。", "速率相同时，圆环的能量更多：在平地上它滚动得更远，", "摩擦力相同，并能爬得更高（$h = v^2(1 + k)/2g$）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:systems-of-points:6}", "HCl：$\\mu = 35m_H/36 = 0.972m_H$；原子：$\\mu = m_e/(1 + 1/1836) =", "0.99946m_e$。频率 $\\propto 1/\\sqrt\\mu$：HCl 增加 $+1.4\\%$，", "氢增加 $+0.027\\%$（H 与 D 光谱之间的同位素位移即由此而来）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:systems-of-points:7}", "$J = ML^2/3$，$d = L/2$：$T = 2\\pi\\sqrt{(ML^2/3)/(MgL/2)} = 2\\pi\\sqrt{2L/3g}", "= \\qty{1.64}{s}$；等效摆长 $2L/3 = \\qty{0.67}{m}$。在", "打击中心施加冲击，细杆将绕支点转动，支点处无冲击性反作用力；", "击球时若击中球棒的“甜区”，", "双手便不会感到震痛。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:systems-of-points:8}", "$J = \\tfrac12 MR^2 = \\qty{1.0e-3}{kg.m^2}$；$C = 4\\pi^2J/T^2 = \\qty{9.9e-3}{N.m/rad}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:systems-of-points:9}", "$\\omega = \\qty{314}{rad/s}$，$E = \\tfrac12 J\\omega^2 = \\qty{4.9e5}{J}$；", "$\\Gamma = J\\omega/t = \\qty{314}{N.m}$；转数：$\\tfrac12\\omega t/2\\pi = 250$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:systems-of-points:10}", "$a = g\\sin\\alpha/(1 + k)$：球体（$k = 2/5$）为 $0.714$，圆柱体（$1/2$）为", "$0.667$，圆环（$1$）为 $0.500$，均乘以 $g\\sin\\alpha$：球体最先到达，圆环最后；", "其中不含质量或半径。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:systems-of-points:11}", "动量：$0.010 \\times 400 = 2.01\\,v$，$v = \\qty{2.0}{m/s}$；再由能量：", "$h = v^2/2g = \\qty{0.20}{m}$。$E_k$：碰撞前 \\qty{800}{J}，$\\tfrac12 \\times", "2.01 \\times 4.0 = \\qty{4.0}{J}$（碰撞后），$99.5\\%$ 转化为形变能与", "热量。碰撞是非弹性的——能量在此过程中不守恒，", "动量守恒（绳的张力竖直，且碰撞时间极短）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:systems-of-points:12}", "$m_1v_1 = m_1v_1' + m_2v_2'$ 与 $m_1v_1^2 = m_1v_1'^2 + m_2v_2'^2$ 联立，", "得 $v_1 + v_1' = v_2'$（将能量方程除以动量方程），", "由此得出各公式。传递给靶的能量比 $4m_1m_2/(m_1 + m_2)^2$：", "质子 $100\\%$；碳 $4 \\times 12/169 = 28\\%$；铅 $4 \\times 207/208^2 =", "1.9\\%$。轻原子核经几次碰撞即可带走中子能量，", "（水、石墨）；铅则需数百次。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:b1:systems-of-points:1}", "\\textbf{1.} 在轴上，位于圆盘中心处，由对称性可得。", "", "\\textbf{2.} 柯尼希定理：$E_k = \\tfrac12 Mv_G^2 + E_k^*$，在", "质心参考系中，悠悠球绕其轴转动：$E_k^* = \\tfrac12 J\\omega^2$。", "", "\\textbf{3.} 半径为 $\\rho$ 的圆环，质量为 $2M\\rho\\,\\dd\\rho/R^2$：$J = \\int_0^R", "\\rho^2\\cdot 2M\\rho\\,\\dd\\rho/R^2 = MR^2/2 = 0.5 \\times 0.050 \\times 9\\times10^{-4}", "= \\qty{2.25e-5}{kg.m^2}$。", "", "\\textbf{4.} 细绳固定，并从轴上退绕：轴上与之接触的点", "瞬时静止，故 $v_G = r\\omega$。", "", "\\textbf{5.} $E_k = \\tfrac12 Mv_G^2 + \\tfrac12(\\tfrac12 MR^2)(v_G/r)^2 = \\tfrac12", "Mv_G^2(1 + R^2/2r^2)$；$R^2/2r^2 = 9/(2 \\times 0.16) = 28$：因子为 $29$ ---", "几乎全部能量都在自旋中。", "", "\\textbf{6.} 重力 $Mg$ 向下，张力 $T$ 向上：$Ma_G = Mg - T$。", "", "\\textbf{7.} 只有张力对轴有力矩（力臂为 $r$）：", "$J\\dot\\omega = Tr$。", "", "\\textbf{8.} $\\dot\\omega = a_G/r$：$T = Ja_G/r^2 = (R^2/2r^2)Ma_G$；于是", "$Ma_G = Mg - (R^2/2r^2)Ma_G$，$a_G = g/29 = \\qty{0.34}{m/s^2}$。", "", "\\textbf{9.} $T = M(g - a_G) = 0.050 \\times 9.47 = \\qty{0.47}{N}$，为", "重力的 $97\\%$：细绳几乎承受了全部重量。", "", "\\textbf{10.} $t = \\sqrt{2h/a_G} = \\qty{2.4}{s}$；$v_G = a_Gt = \\qty{0.82}{m/s}$。", "一颗石子：\\qty{0.45}{s} 与 \\qty{4.4}{m/s}。", "", "\\textbf{11.} $\\omega = v_G/r = \\qty{205}{rad/s} = \\qty{1960}{rpm}$。", ""]}